# Claude Code agents, shifts, scripts and hooks are not part of the image
.claude
**/.claude
# Local env files hold secrets (API keys, JWT secret, database URLs): never in the image. Railway
# builds from git, where they are ignored; a local `docker build` would otherwise copy
# FullStackHub/apps/api/.env or apps/web/.env.local in. The committed template stays.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
